---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Japanese Language Preparation | JLPT, JFT, JLCT | Link Wave"
  description="Prepare for Japanese language tests including JLPT, JFT, and JLCT at Link Wave Global Study. Study in Japan starts here."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="tp-hero">
    <div class="hero-banner">
    </div>
    <div class="hero-overlay">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-text reveal">
          <span class="badge">Language Preparation</span>
          <h1>Japanese Language</h1>
          <p>Prepare for JLPT, JFT, and JLCT examinations. Structured courses for Nepali students planning to study or work in Japan.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="contact-us" class="btn btn-gold">Enroll Now</a>
            <a href="tel:+9779851410481" class="btn btn-outline-white">Call Us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Offer -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">What We Offer</h2>
      <p class="section-desc reveal">Structured Japanese language courses designed for Nepali students preparing to study or work in Japan.</p>
      
      <div class="services-list reveal">
        <div class="service-row">
          
          <div class="service-content">
            <h3>JLPT Preparation (N5 to N2)</h3>
            <p>The Japanese Language Proficiency Test is the most widely recognized Japanese language certification worldwide. We prepare students for N5 (beginner) through N2 (business level).</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="service-row">
          
          <div class="service-content">
            <h3>JFT (Japan Foundation Test)</h3>
            <p>The Japan Foundation Test for Basic Japanese is required for the Specified Skilled Worker (SSW) visa. Our course focuses on practical communication skills needed in Japanese workplaces.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="service-row">
         
          <div class="service-content">
            <h3>JLCT (Japanese Language Capability Test)</h3>
            <p>The Japanese Language Capability Test is accepted by Japanese immigration for student and work visas. We provide complete preparation with mock tests and personalized feedback.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="service-row">
         
          <div class="service-content">
            <h3>Conversational Japanese</h3>
            <p>Practical speaking and listening skills for daily life in Japan. Covers greetings, shopping, transportation, and workplace communication. Ideal for students planning to study or work in Japan.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- Why Japanese -->  <!-- Why Learn Japanese -->
  <section class="section bg-light">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">Why Learn Japanese</h2>
      
      <div class="why-list reveal">
        <div class="why-item">
          <span class="why-number">01</span>
          <p>Japanese language skills are essential for admission to Japanese universities and vocational schools.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <span class="why-number">02</span>
          <p>Japan's growing demand for international workers creates opportunities for Japanese-speaking professionals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <span class="why-number">03</span>
          <p>MEXT and JASSO scholarship programs often require or prefer Japanese language proficiency.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <span class="why-number">04</span>
          <p>Understanding Japanese language opens access to one of the world's largest economies and richest cultures.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- Levels -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">JLPT Levels</h2>
      
      <div class="levels-table reveal">
        <div class="level-row">
          <div class="level-badge">N5</div>
          <div class="level-info">
            <h4>Beginner</h4>
            <p>Basic understanding of hiragana, katakana, and simple kanji. Basic conversations for daily life.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="level-row">
          <div class="level-badge">N4</div>
          <div class="level-info">
            <h4>Elementary</h4>
            <p>Ability to understand basic Japanese in everyday situations. Reading simple sentences and passages.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="level-row">
          <div class="level-badge">N3</div>
          <div class="level-info">
            <h4>Intermediate</h4>
            <p>Understand Japanese used in everyday situations. Read and comprehend daily topics.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="level-row">
          <div class="level-badge">N2</div>
          <div class="level-info">
            <h4>Business Level</h4>
            <p>Ability to understand Japanese in various circumstances. Required for most university admissions and professional jobs in Japan.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</MainLayout>

<style>
  .tp-hero {
    position: relative;
    height: 500px;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--primary-white);
  }
  .hero-banner {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .banner-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }
  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: rgb(36, 54, 120);
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
    .hero-text { 
    max-width: 600px; 
    position: relative; 
    z-index: 3;
    margin-left: 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
    .tp-hero .container {
    padding-left: 2rem;
    display: block;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero-overlay .container {
    margin-left: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
  }
  .hero-text h1 { color: var(--primary-white); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .hero-text p { opacity: 0.9; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }  .btn-gold {
    background: #ffd700;
    color: var(--secondary);
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }
  .btn-gold:hover {
    background: #ffe44d;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255,215,0,0.3);
  }
  .btn-outline-white {
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    color: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }
  .btn-outline-white:hover { background: var(--primary-white); color: var(--secondary); }

  .section { padding: 5rem 0; }
  .bg-light { background: var(--gray-100); }
  .section-title { text-align: left; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .section-desc { text-align: left; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 0 3rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; }

  .services-list { max-width: 750px; }
  .service-row { padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200); }
  .service-row:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200); }
  .service-row h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; color: var(--secondary); }
  .service-row p { color: #555; line-height: 1.7; }

  .why-list { 
    max-width: 650px; 
  }
  
  .why-item { 
    display: flex; 
    gap: 1.5rem; 
    padding: 1.25rem 0; 
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200); 
    align-items: flex-start; 
  }
  
  .why-item:first-child { 
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200); 
  }
  
  .why-number { 
    font-size: 0.85rem; 
    font-weight: 700; 
    color: var(--tertiary); 
    flex-shrink: 0; 
    width: 30px; 
  }
  
  .why-item p { 
    color: #444; 
    line-height: 1.7; 
    margin: 0; 
  }
  .levels-table { max-width: 650px; }
  .level-row { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200); align-items: flex-start; }
  .level-row:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200); }
  .level-badge { width: 50px; height: 50px; background: var(--tertiary); color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .level-info h4 { color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .level-info p { color: #555; line-height: 1.7; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .tp-hero { height: auto; min-height: 450px; }
    .hero-text h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
    .level-row { flex-direction: column; text-align: left; }
  }
</style>